# The hash of every tracked file under web and brand,
# written by `make web-shell` and verified by `make ssg-check`. It is how a
# committed build that no longer matches its sources is caught, which is a
# thing nothing else notices: the shell is embedded at compile time and a
# stale one builds perfectly.
